From: Jens Willmer <info@jwillmer.de>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 01:12:38 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 36/56] Find fold ranges and fold, unfold and skip folded lines

Brackets for JSON and C-like files, headings for Markdown and indentation
for the rest. The fold state lives in the line attributes, so folds move
with the text; a hit inside a fold reveals it and vertical motions step
over it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

